          "book": "RUT",
          "chapter": 4,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Boaz took ten men of the elders of the city, and said, “Sit down here,” and they sat down.",
      "ko": "보아스가 성읍 장로 십인을 청하여 가로되 당신들은 여기 앉으라 그들이 앉으매",
      "source_text_hash": "0be79a612439be8a9bb0b1f1aa2f3d0815c19f7cbe71a52300c1de83c6961383",
      "translation_text_hash": "557b3ac05f18ebb2cf9b84bfff48a9023970dd036c1bbd968d61ffb3b03af243",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "보아스가 성읍 장로 십인을 청하여 가로되 당신들은 여기 앉으라 그들이 앉으매"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "557b3ac05f18ebb2cf9b84bfff48a9023970dd036c1bbd968d61ffb3b03af243"
      ]
