      "en": "So Boaz took Ruth and she became his wife; and he went in to her, and the LORD enabled her to conceive, and she bore a son.",
      "ko": "이에 보아스가 룻을 취하여 아내를 삼고 그와 동침하였더니 여호와께서 그로 잉태케 하시므로 그가 아들을 낳은지라",
      "source_text_hash": "a684713816481b94d523ab5df30d05b975dbc7e87b33d13f2bc375f0c7b6c8fb",
